# CODEOWNERS — automatic reviewer assignment.
# The LAST matching pattern wins, so order matters: general rules first,
# specific overrides last.
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @{{ORG}}

# Anything that can change how code is built, tested, or shipped.
/.github/               @{{ORG}}
/.github/workflows/     @{{ORG}}

# Supply-chain surface: submodule pointers and the module registry.
/.gitmodules            @{{ORG}}
/registry/              @{{ORG}}

# Security-relevant policy files.
/SECURITY.md            @{{ORG}}
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @{{ORG}}

# Replace the individual owners above with teams once one exists, e.g.
#   *                   @{{ORG}}/maintainers
#   /.github/workflows/ @{{ORG}}/platform
